Use this section to set up testing in your mobile application and run your first tests. Follow the pages in order. The examples use **MyChickenapp** to check chicken ordering and sign-in success and failure.

## Understand the journey

You write test files in the application repository. Run the local checks from your IDE terminal, review the results, and push the change. Bitrise runs the configured checks. The device workflow builds the app and runs the selected tests on Sauce Labs phones.

