Use @enterprise/rn-appium-framework and the existing BasePage subclass.
Use accessibility IDs only. Put locators and waits in the page object.
The spec should call page actions and assert the visible order confirmation.
Read test credentials from process.env. Start each test from app launch
using the existing runner lifecycle. Do not add fixed sleeps.
Return the changed page object and spec, and identify missing context.
```

Run `npm run test:e2e:verify` and `npm run pipeline:local` after reviewing the draft. Run `npm run test:e2e` only after the target, app package, and isolated fixture are configured. Verify the actual assertions on the selected device.

